/* ===== agent J j003: Statistics card rank badge (tester g6b: j01_d[2] rising, state 3 all along, but no badge) =====
 * The card builds the badge as content item type 0x29 with the rank from 0x781ea0 (0x61d0b1..0x61d0c4, items of 0x30 bytes in
 * the layout pool: +0 type, +8 texture, +0x10 value, +0x1c/+0x24 = -1, +0x28 = 1.0; = event[2..12] of a list op 4). PS4's item
 * draw switch 0x64205b (table 0x6473c8, index type - 4) sends type 0x29 to the default 0x645eea: PS4 has no rank-badge drawer,
 * which is why v5.41 answers list badges as a texture icon (rank_icon_as_texture: type 2, vtex "ranks/<n>" / prestige). The
 * card's item is built inline, so kind 224 (x-stub 0x16b80 at 0x61d28b, 'mov [rcx+0xf8],rdi' = the node's content pointer,
 * replayed first) applies the same conversion to that item. U3MP_STATS_BADGE=0 (builder) leaves it out.
 * Diagnostics j03_d: [0] badge items seen, [1] converted, [2] last rank value, [3] texture misses. */
