/* ===== fixer W w011: the co-op hero descs in PS4 net.bin are byte-reversed in their first word =====
 * PS3 1.19 net.bin desc (0x2c, BE): 03 00 00 00 | ... | ff212916 (tints, u32) | ... ; byte 0 = character type
 * (DC 0xbd3bb3b9: 0 hunter = the custom hero, 2 coop-cutter, 3 drake-french, 4 elena, 5 sullivan, 6 chloe).
 * PS4 net.bin (original CUSA02320 and every overlay) converted the whole desc as u32 words, so the four u8 at +0 became
 * 00 00 00 03: byte 0 reads 0 = "hunter". The native copy 0x7294c1 (0x727440 match setup) puts that raw desc into
 * player +0x620 and the spawn / look want / lobby read byte 0 = hunter, i.e. the custom hero (v6.59 run 1793354950:
 * w09_d[7] = 0x10000 / 0x20000 = type 0, net games 0x84 / 0x81 with the native copy in place).
 * Fix: reverse +0..+3 back in the loaded DC (idempotent: only when bytes 0..2 are 0 and byte 3 is a type), for all
 * type-11 entries, before the match setup copies them (from the lobby stub every lobby frame and from the spawn stub).
 * Tints (+0x14 / +0x1c) and the hash (+0x24) are real u32 and stay as they are. Switch: U3MP_COOP_HERO119=0 (w009's bit). */
